tor and within the private) Tj 0 -14 Td (sector. To both government-funded space agencies and private enterprises alike, there is a) Tj 0 -14 Td (continuously growing and ever more significant advancement in the design, creation and) Tj 0 -14 Td (large-scale deployment of satellite constellations, pushing the boundaries of what is) Tj 0 -14 Td (technologically achievable in orbital infrastructure. At the same time, the introduction and) Tj 0 -14 Td (rapid deployment of 5G networks globally has only served to further highlight and underscore the) Tj 0 -14 Td (pressing need to have a fully connected, seamless global communication system capable of) Tj 0 -14 Td (supporting unprecedented amounts of data traffic, and different user demands.) Tj 0 -14 Td () Tj 0 -14 Td () Tj 0 -14 Td (Satellites are also being proposed and recognized as highly effective solutions to establishing) Tj 0 -14 Td (high-throughput and low-latency communication links between locations, in particular in remote,) Tj 0 -14 Td (rural, and hard-to-reach locations where terrestrial communication infrastructure is severely) Tj 0 -14 Td (limited, prohibitively expensive to deploy, or entirely unavailable. The space-based systems) Tj 0 -14 Td (provide a special edge in overcoming the digital divide by bringing reliable connectivity to) Tj 0 -14 Td (underserved populations and areas that the more traditional ground-based networks simply can not) Tj 0 -14 Td (reach. But the rapid and accelerating growth in the number of satellites being launched into the) Tj 0 -14 Td (orbit of the earth has both simultaneously given rise to a series of significant challenges and) Tj 0 -14 Td (discrepancies within the overall system which include increased complexity of operation,) Tj ET
