BT /F1 10 Tf 44 742 Td (increased risk of signal interference, the possibility of collision due to the growing orbital) Tj 0 -14 Td (congestion and mounting difficulties in the coordinated management and control of these) Tj 0 -14 Td (large-scale constellations.) Tj 0 -14 Td () Tj 0 -14 Td () Tj 0 -14 Td (This is because, directly as a result of these compounding issues, there is an immediate and) Tj 0 -14 Td (increasingly pressing need to develop highly adaptive, resilient and flexible satellite) Tj 0 -14 Td (communication systems that are fully capable of overcoming these challenges and efficiently) Tj 0 -14 Td (managing the ever-increasing global demand of quality and reliable connectivity. Within this) Tj 0 -14 Td (changing and challenging arena, the use of Machine Learning \(ML\) and Deep Learning \(DL\) has) Tj 0 -14 Td (become especially popular and significant in the wider realm of communication systems due to) Tj 0 -14 Td (their shown capacities to substantially enhance the performance of a system, to enhance its) Tj 0 -14 Td (adaptability to various circumstances, to enable real-time decision-making, and to support) Tj 0 -14 Td (autonomous system control without the need to constantly monitor and make decisions in the) Tj 0 -14 Td (system.) Tj 0 -14 Td () Tj 0 -14 Td () Tj 0 -14 Td (This review is a rich and comprehensive information on how the powerful and versatile) Tj 0 -14 Td (methodologies of ML and DL can be strategically implemented in a broad spectrum of diverse) Tj 0 -14 Td (satellite communication subsystems and applications in a wide variety of different satellite) Tj 0 -14 Td (system applications. By the careful and systematic introduction of Artificial Intelligence \(AI\)) Tj 0 -14 Td (into satellite architectures, these advanced space-based systems can be able to achieve more) Tj 0 -14 Td (efficient and optimized operation, better spectral use, better signal processing, and overall) Tj 0 -14 Td (better performance under different and unpredictable environmental conditions.) Tj 0 -14 Td () Tj 0 -14 Td () Tj 0 -14 Td (Along with seeking out these promising opportunities, this review also critically examines,) Tj 0 -14 Td (analyzes, and discusses the current open challenges and unresolved technical barriers related to) Tj 0 -14 Td (the practical implementation of AI in satellite communication systems. Also, it identifies and) Tj 0 -14 Td (discusses potential future research directions with a specific focus on developing the) Tj 0 -14 Td (capabilities, robustness, scalability and long-term effectiveness of these intelligent and) Tj 0 -14 Td (autonomous technologies in the constantly changing environment of space-based communication) Tj 0 -14 Td (networks. \(Bhattacharyya et al., 2023\)) Tj 0 -14 Td () Tj 0 -14 Td () Tj 0 -14 Td (6.2 Integration with 6G Network) Tj 0 -14 Td () Tj 0 -14 Td () Tj 0 -14 Td (The dire need to create strong and multi-layered Aerospace Integrated Networks \(AINs\) has become) Tj 0 -14 Td (so acute with the ever-increasing and rapidly escalating global demand in creating ubiquitous,) Tj 0 -14 Td (reliable and highly differentiated communication services accessible at any given time, and) Tj 0 -14 Td (under virtually any other location on the Earth. These advanced and architecturally) Tj 0 -14 Td (sophisticated networks are designed around multiple interconnected levels, including) Tj 0 -14 Td (high-altitude platforms \(HAPs\), unmanned aerial vehicles \(UAVs\) and low earth orbit \(LEO\)) Tj 0 -14 Td (satellites among other aerial and space-based nodes, all operating in coordinated tandem to) Tj 0 -14 Td (provide wide-area coverage and substantially high network capacity. Each level of the AIN is) Tj 0 -14 Td (uniquely and complementarily valuable to the system as a whole, with LEO satellites particularly) Tj 0 -14 Td (serving as a backbone layer with significant value in the entire system.) Tj 0 -14 Td () Tj 0 -14 Td () Tj ET
