e field still faces a number of long-standing,) Tj 0 -14 Td (complicated and technically challenging issues that require ongoing and intensive research) Tj 0 -14 Td (attention. Atmospheric attenuation - which is also caused by rain fade, tropospheric) Tj 0 -14 Td (scintillation and ionospheric disturbances continues to impair signal quality and link) Tj 0 -14 Td (reliability especially in the higher frequency Ka-band systems most commonly associated with) Tj 0 -14 Td (High-Throughput Satellite operations. The latency caused by the geostationary satellite) Tj 0 -14 Td (communications as a result of the vast distances through which the signals have to travel is a) Tj 0 -14 Td (fundamental constraint to real-time and delay-sensitive applications, but the rapidly increasing) Tj 0 -14 Td (deployment of LEO constellation networks is actively, and progressively, alleviating this) Tj 0 -14 Td (constraint. Moreover, the rapid increase in the number of satellites in Earth orbital) Tj 0 -14 Td (environment has heightened the concerns with regard to orbital debris formation, conjunction) Tj 0 -14 Td (hazards and sustainability of major orbital regimes. At the same time, due to the increasing) Tj 0 -14 Td (strategic value of satellite infrastructure, satellite-transmitted data has become an) Tj 0 -14 Td (increasingly attractive target of advanced, multi-layered security architecture and encryption) Tj 0 -14 Td (frameworks to ensure the integrity and confidentiality of data transmitted by satellites.) Tj 0 -14 Td () Tj 0 -14 Td () Tj 0 -14 Td (Despite these obstacles, the course of the evolution of technologies in the sphere of satellite) Tj 0 -14 Td (communication is highly and undoubtedly positive. The continuing and accelerating convergence of) Tj 0 -14 Td (satellite systems with next-generation terrestrial networks, most immediately with the) Tj 0 -14 Td (infrastructure of fifth-generation \(5G\) networks and potentially in the future with the) Tj 0 -14 Td (infrastructure of 